  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scatec. Hydropower and solar PV development in Gabon and Guinea</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The agreement is under Norad&apos;s Enterprise for Development Scheme. Norad supports development of hydropower projects. In Gabon, this applies to the brownfield Kingu&#xE9;l&#xE9; and Tchimb&#xE9;l&#xE9; projects and the greenfield Sindara project. In Guinea, this applies to the hybrid Kogb&#xE9;dou Frankon&#xE9;dou hydropower and solar project. Supported activities include, among others, pre-feasibility and feasibility studies, environmental and social studies and project structuring.</narrative>
  </description>
